==German==

===Etymology===
Alteration (with {{m|de||-ch}}) of {{der|de|gmh|mol}}, {{m|gmh|molle}}, from {{der|de|goh|mol}}, {{m|goh|mollo|mol(l)o}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*mulô}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*molh₂-o-}} (compare {{cog|lt|mulvas|mul̃vas|t=yellow, clayey}}, {{cog|la|mulleus|t=ruddy (shoes)}}, {{cog|sa|मल|tr=mála|t=dirt}}), from {{m|ine-pro|*melh₂-|t=dark color}}.<ref>{{R:de:EWbD|Molch}}</ref> More at {{m|de|malen}}.

